### ============================================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN - POST /api/auth/login
### 🔓 Acceso: PÚBLICO (no requiere token)
### ============================================================

### Iniciar Sesión como SUPERADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ---

### Iniciar Sesión como ADMIN de empresa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carlos_admin",
  "password": "72345678"
}

### ---

### Iniciar Sesión como EMPLEADO / Cajero
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maria_cajera",
  "password": "71234567"
}
